   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Nothing was fetched from britishmuseum.org. Its robots.txt reserves AI collection of its pages and lists this kind of client under Disallow, and its own object photography is CC BY-NC-SA, which is not an open licence. Everything here is recorded from the open cuneiform catalogues and from Wikidata, with a link on to the museum's own page — the reference use its signal does permit. Any photograph shown is a Wikimedia Commons photograph of the object, not the museum's."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "2,727 records are held for this collection and 120 are listed here — the ones its own records tie to something biblical, audited first. The rest are in the research corpus, not on this page."
